{
  "id": "section-side-mission-table",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Side Mission table (d6)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,22,46]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1 Bring in this box the head of a vampire or demon to claim the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,46,110]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "reward.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,110,118]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "2\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,118,120]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Take a person from this box to a Safe House that has already\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,120,181]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "been revealed. If no safe houses are in play, you must take\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,181,241]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "this person to the most distant unrevealed box on the map\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,241,299]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "(there is no guarantee that it will be a Safe House. And you will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,299,365]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have to deal with any encounter in that box).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,365,411]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "3 Give 4 Food points to the next House encounter with helpful\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,411,473]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "people to claim the reward.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,473,501]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "4 Defeat a random enemy from the Beast table to claim the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,501,559]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "reward. The combat happens in your current location.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,559,612]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "5\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,612,614]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Perform a ritual to re-consecrate a church. The next church\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,614,674]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you discover in town will be a deconsecrated church, unless\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,674,734]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you ALREADY have a deconsecrated church on the map.  You\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,734,791]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "must have the Faith Skill and the Holy book, and use 3 candles\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,791,854]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "in the ritual. As soon as this is accomplished, come back to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,854,915]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "this location to claim your reward.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,915,951]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,951,953]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Bring here the mask of Walrus the Clown to claim the reward.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,953,1014]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "This side mission may happen only once in the campaign.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,1014,1070]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Once it has happened, reroll this result until you select a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,1070,1130]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "different side mission.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,1130,1154]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "When you accept a side mission, you may alter your roll on the Town\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,1154,1222]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Exploration table by +1 or -1 IF this lets you reach a location that is required\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,1222,1303]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to complete your mission. Likewise, you may alter an encounter table by +1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,1303,1378]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "or -1 if this lets you encounter a specific creature that you have to kill. For\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,1378,1458]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "example, if you are trying to complete Side Mission 1 and you roll on the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,1458,1532]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Undead table, you may count a roll of 5 as a 6 so that you can encounter a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,1532,1607]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-side-mission-table:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "vampire and kill it.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[74,1607,1627]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    74
  ]
}
